REQUIRED FROM THE HOST, names to be confirmed against V26:
  model.documentFingerprint   — the analysis fingerprint for the open document
  model.extractionVersion     — must be >= 4; the packet builder refuses below that
  model.explainController     — one ExplanationController per reader session, built via
                                ExplainLikeTenFeature.live(...) as shown in CODEX_INTEGRATION.md

If the packet builder returns nil the sheet does not present, which is the correct
behaviour for a too-short, over-long or damaged selection. Consider surfacing the existing
`savedMessage` affordance in that case rather than adding a new alert.

